{"channelId":"UCcRsU12NQUwGV8kpO2wZXdQ","row":["FishysFriendsRescue",2,"🐾 Fishy’s Friends Rescue – YouTube Channel Description\nFishy’s Friends Rescue is a foster-based, 501(c)(3) nonprofit serving Comanche County, Oklahoma, and surrounding areas. Our mission is simple but urgent: to rescue, rehabilitate, and re home homeless and abandoned dogs while addressing the root causes of pet overpopulation through education and community outreach.\nWe are not a shelter—we are a network of everyday people opening their homes and hearts to dogs in need. From dumped litters to overlooked strays, we focus on the dogs who have nowhere else to go.\nOn this channel, you’ll find:\nFoster journeys and training education\nEducation on responsible pet ownership and prevention\nCommunity initiatives, events, and outreach efforts\nThe reality of rescue—both the wins and the hard days\nJoin us. Adopt. Foster. Donate.Volunteer.Educate.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcRsU12NQUwGV8kpO2wZXdQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcRsU12NQUwGV8kpO2wZXdQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:16.792Z","channelId":"UCcRsU12NQUwGV8kpO2wZXdQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"fd4e6496e4b5131199e76b0d3b46909d708050f49cbdcebbabb0f56079e51950","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"31deed349c3ff0b19b9b4b52edfa3f16111bacd3edb6a60a391cca3d4ebaa29d"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcRsU12NQUwGV8kpO2wZXdQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2,"raw":"2 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcRsU12NQUwGV8kpO2wZXdQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:16.792Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biogra